:: Carter Hang Out End Early Low Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */

As <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> rushes on ahead of you in the middle of an idle ramble about what he wants to do next, you have to break the news to him that it is time for you to go. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> spins around, <span style="color:LightCoral">a look of disbelief on his face,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What do you mean you have to go? But we like – JUST started! We’ve hardly done anything yet!”</span> The boy complains, technically having a point. <br>

<<set _ad to [
	{
		Name: "Carter",
		State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
			Mouth: "Frown",
            Eyes: "Sad",
		},
	},
	{
		Name: "Player",
		State: {
			Mouth: "Frown",
		},
	},
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

Alas, you tell him that you are out of time and have to go. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> opens his mouth, likely to complain again, before sighing loudly. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Fineeeeee! I guess we can hang out more next time. But you owe me! Next time we have to have twice the fun – no – three times as much fun!”</span> You laugh and promise <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> that things will be more fun next time, <span style="color:LightCoral">though it is obvious he is still upset.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Carter" -3>>
<br>
[[Continue|Park]]


:: Carter Hang Out End Early High Fun [nobr]

As <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> rushes on ahead of you in the middle of an idle ramble about what he wants to do next, you have to break the news to him that it is time for you to go. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> spins around, a look of sadness on his face, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But- but- But we’re having so much fun and I wanted to-”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> pauses, seeing the apologetic look on your far, then sighs. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alright, alright. I guess if you have to go, complaining won’t change it. At least we had fun today!”</span> <br>

<<set _ad to [
	{
		Name: "Carter",
		State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
			Mouth: "Happy",
		},
	},
	{
		Name: "Player",
		State: {
			Mouth: "Happy",
		},
	},
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightGreen"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> gives you a smile, obviously wishing he could spend more time with you, but understanding that you have to go.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But we better hang out again soon! It’s too much fun to not to!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> gives you a friendly wave goodbye before walking off himself. <span style="color:LightGreen">It was a fun day.</span> <br>
<br>
